<Layout
  title="Gas Line Sizing for Tankless Water Heaters (NFPA 54 Tables) | CalcForDIY"
  description="Master gas pipe sizing for 199,000 BTU tankless water heaters. The NFPA 54 / IFGC longest run method, natural gas CFH demand, and avoiding 1/2-inch line errors."
